Subject: Add PQ3 compressed-cache Vulkan writes, copies and flash-attention decoding
Base: llama.cpp a34de8618b25dfc32ee43749db47d767a9f0a25d (b12015), after 0003-0009
License: MIT; upstream license and PQ3 attribution retained

PQ3 row ABI v1 remains 128 values / 50 bytes, indices before FP16 L2 scale.
Add storage/decode for scalar, coopmat1 and coopmat2 FA, and indexed cache writes
for F32/F16 sources with I32/I64 indices. Existing weight GEMM registration is
unchanged. Decode consumes packed bytes directly, without a persistent full-cache
FP16 shadow. Native context device preflight and numerical/placement tests are
required before enabling GPU contexts or staging this patch.

